# Upstream libwdi pinned by the libwdi-static pipeline.
#
# v1.5.1 is a *lightweight* tag, so this is the commit the tag points at;
# it was resolved offline with:
#   git ls-remote https://github.com/pbatard/libwdi.git refs/tags/v1.5.1
#
# Tags are mutable. The build script refuses to run unless this file contains
# a full 40-hex commit SHA, checks the checked-out commit against it, and the
# workflow caller passes the same SHA as `libwdi-sha`. Upgrading libwdi is a
# deliberate change: edit this file, regenerate patches/, and publish a new
# immutable tag (libwdi-<upstream>-x64-r<N>).
